{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01KfPFM22onbBMn35U9yb2FS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Anchor R&D Control Surface â€” Master Plan (frozen design)\n\n**Goal / North Star (locked)**\n- Transform Anchor from a task/project tracker into a **per-project R&D control surface**, where each code project is a folder (e.g. `C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home`, `C:\\dev\\Anchor`).\n- A single-instance dashboard window drives the **researchPrime â†’ Crucible â†’ Foreman** trio as durable, server-owned Claude Code jobs running on gwl-server.\n- Scope of the surface includes: versioned effort history, taskâ†”project integration, project lifecycle states, deliverable execution, and a data-free public distribution.\n\n**Locked architectural decisions**\n- **D1 â€” One uniform job primitive.** A job is `claude -p --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json` running the relevant skill (researchPrime / Crucible / Foreman) in the project cwd, **owned by the Anchor server**. A \"lane\" is just which skill + prompt template is used â€” no per-lane orchestration code, no PTY, stdlib only.\n- **D2 â€” Gate handling is in-session.** A skill's `AskUserQuestion` gate surfaces in the stream (it auto-dismisses headless, but the structured question stays visible); Anchor renders it in a prompt box and sends the user's choice back as a plain text turn to continue the run.\n\n**Locked user decisions (from the Decision Log, Crucible 2026-06-07/08)**\n- This is a **brownfield extension** of Anchor (`C:\\dev\\Anchor`); objective = adding new capability.\n- Session model = **streaming console, stdlib-only** â€” not a full TUI, no PTY, no dependencies.\n- Registry = a **new parallel R&D registry**, kept distinct from the existing life-domain projects.\n- Artifacts live **inside each project's `.anchor/`** as pointer-records; engine outputs remain in their native form.\n- v1 scope = **all three trio lanes, Claude Code CLI only**; Gemini support deferred.\n- Auth = run the **Anchor service as `john`**, which resolves the LocalSystem credential wall.\n- Remote access = **bind the Tailscale interface + a shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*` endpoints.\n\n**Provenance**\n- Decisions were driven by an adversarial (Crucible) planning process, dated 2026-06-07/08.\n- Member documents: Master Plan (frozen design), Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, and Decision Log.\n\n*Note: the provided anchors are truncated mid-sentence in D2 and the locked-decisions list, so claims here are limited to what the member-document excerpts actually state.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45166,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4aa648c2-5883-41c6-b3bf-a35eb321dc5c","uuid":"426ae95a-0bf8-46bd-8e3d-6286a8bdfa8a","request_id":"req_011Cc1JMWUY43kwRJzX3Beyf"}
